SUMMARY: Community Plant Swap at the Liberty Village Eco-Fair
DESCRIPTION:Toronto plant lovers are invited to a free neighbourhood plan
 t exchange for seasoned growers\, curious beginners and anyone ready to t
 ake home something green. Bring healthy\, pest-free potted plants\, plant
  babies\, rooted cuttings\, herbs\, succulents or cacti. Registration ope
 ns at 4:30 p.m. and the plant swap runs from 5 to 6 p.m. Participants rec
 eive one swap ticket for each eligible plant they bring. No plant? You ca
 n still come meet local plant people and browse\, though availability for
  non-swappers is not guaranteed. RSVP encouraged and walk-ins welcome. Pa
 rt of the free Liberty Village Eco-Fair.
