 1c2599e757/6a99a23188c0f3494063a03b/scaled_896.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Things Fall Apart: In Conversation with Allison Glen
 n\, Curator\, Toronto Biennial of Art 2026 Join us! September 16\, 2026 7
 :00pm 100 McCaul Street\,...
LOCATION:OCAD University Auditorium\,100 McCaul St\, Toronto\, ON M5T 2W7
 \, Canada
