SUMMARY: “The Built Metaphor” films by Robert Beavers and Ute Aurand
DESCRIPTION:Join Ute Aurand and Robert Beavers in person for a two-day pr
 ogram of screenings and discussion exploring affinities between cinema an
 d architecture through their work.\n\nPartners of twenty years and two of
  experimental cinema's most distinctive voices\, Aurand and Beavers have 
 rarely had their films presented in dialogue. "The Built Metaphor" (Oct. 
 5) focuses on urban architectural space\, ornament and construction.\n\n“
 The Built Metaphor” will be followed by a panel discussion with the filmm
 akers\, Claire Zimmerman and Robert Levit.\n\nMore Info: www.daniels.utor
 onto.ca/events/1791172800/film-screening-aurand-beavers-architecture-and-
 dwelling https://www.daniels.utoronto.ca/events/1791172800/film-screening
