  late check-out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly
  Social.\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\nEvery funky S
 unday funday\, at your service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG 
 https://on.soundcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPL
 IMENTARY Entry before 10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm ~ $6 Vodka & Beer speci
 als before 11pm\n\nit's a Sunday thang...\n\nSun Oct 18: Sander Kleinenbe
