SUMMARY: ConnectHER Film Festival Toronto Showcase
DESCRIPTION:The ConnectHER Film Festival is an international short film f
 estival that amplifies the voices of young filmmakers telling powerful st
 ories about issues affecting women and girls around the world. Now in its
  14th year\, ConnectHER has received more than 2\,250 film submissions fr
 om 96 countries\, celebrating authentic storytelling and its power to ins
 pire action.\n\nFor the first time in the festival's history\, ConnectHER
  is bringing its acclaimed program beyond Austin\, Texas\, with Toronto b
 ecoming the inaugural city to host the ConnectHER Film Festival Showcase\
 , October 29\, 2026!\n\nThe evening will feature a curated selection of a
 ward-winning and audience favorite short films by emerging filmmakers fro
 m Palestine\, Tibet\, Iran\, Canada\, and beyond\, along with a filmmaker
  Q & A\, special guest speakers\, and live performances\, including write
 r and comedian\, Nour Hadidi!\n\nJoin us for an inspiring evening of film
 \, conversation\, and music that celebrates the next generation of global
  storytellers.
CATEGORIES:Film,TIFF-Lightbox
